    "head_commit_message": "feat(sim): the field's tick on a worker, in the crate (spec 39 step 10d-i)\n\nThe content is shared through an Arc, the field is one simulation\n(FieldSim) that FieldState.step and a new Worker both play, and each\nsnapshot copies only the drawn columns that changed. The worker follows\nthe owner's rules in #734: orders queued to the next tick boundary and\nstamped there, at most two ticks owed, events with their tick's snapshot,\nand the caller never waits on a tick. Presentation is unchanged (10d-ii).\n\nRefs #557. Closes #734.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi3deaHBUmkXCn5zTyv",
